{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1399372-lunars-book-release","id":1399372,"title":"Lunars book release?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-27T14:12:11-07:00","id":1399372,"title":"Lunars book release?","content":"Hello all!<br /> <br /> I've taken a few months / years off of Exalted.<br /> <br /> Any ideas when the new Lunars book is coming out? I can't seem to find the info.<br /> <br /> Thanks for letting me know! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I hope all of you are doing well!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8757-pram","name":"Pram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T14:33:30-07:00","id":1399383,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pram</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1399372-lunars-book-release#post1399372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello all!<br /> <br /> I've taken a few months / years off of Exalted.<br /> <br /> Any ideas when the new Lunars book is coming out? I can't seem to find the info.<br /> <br /> Thanks for letting me know! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I hope all of you are doing well!</div> </div> </div> </div>Currently the book is having backer errata, indexing, and post-preview editting done and will be put on DTRPG sometime in the next few months.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T14:42:42-07:00","id":1399391,"title":"","content":"Yeah it is finished, the backers have the almost-final version, and the devs will do a final pass to correct mistakes and maybe implement light errata, it'll be out for non-backers soon(ish).<br /> Onyx Path haven't given exact release dates for a while now, because back when they did, people got angry at them. So this is the best we can tell you.<br /> Edit: Don't wanna be glib about this, making a book is a big deal for a smaller-than-huge publisher, so it's impossible to give exact release dates, so they don't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T14:46:07-07:00","id":1399393,"title":"","content":"Can anybody recall the timeline when What Fire Has Wrought was in this situation?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T16:03:32-07:00","id":1399417,"title":"","content":"I think it took a couple of months between backer errata copy and final.<br /> <br /> Plus a week cos we found a typo in the finished version that they quickly corrected.<br /> <br /> I think errata is finished collecting now so they just need to go through, fix all the things, add page numbers and stuff.<br /> <br /> And then they send it for final approval and get the Print on Demand ready.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T05:54:42-07:00","id":1399798,"title":"","content":"Before PoD, they'll have to send the files off to the traditional printer, get a test copy back, go through that and see if anything needs correcting, go through that cycle until the book is correct, have it traditionally printed, get it shipped to their distribution partner, have it shipped to backers from there, THEN they'll worry about PoD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T16:53:58-07:00","id":1399944,"title":"","content":"I'm suddenly struck by the sheer injustice of how the peaks of discourse for Fangs at the Gate failed to intersect with the high water mark of attention for Untitled Goose Game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T22:49:43-07:00","id":1400013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1399372-lunars-book-release?p=1399944#post1399944\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm suddenly struck by the sheer injustice of how the peaks of discourse for Fangs at the Gate failed to intersect with the high water mark of attention for Untitled Goose Game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Tell that to the Discord yesterday.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-30T17:05:42-07:00","id":1400208,"title":"","content":"So what do you think? Did they do a good job? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Should I throw money at my screen and buy?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8757-pram","name":"Pram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-30T17:14:43-07:00","id":1400210,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pram</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1399372-lunars-book-release?p=1400208#post1400208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what do you think? Did they do a good job? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Should I throw money at my screen and buy?</div> </div> </div> </div>When you do get a chance, I would <i>absolutely</i> recommend picking up the Lunars book, yes. It's an excellent book, both for fluff (it provides a whole bunch of useful NPCs and locations for people to interact with, as much for non-Lunars as Lunars), and for mechanics (it's got the first really solid mechanical treatment of Lunars in <i>any</i> edition).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-30T17:30:00-07:00","id":1400214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pram</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1399372-lunars-book-release?p=1400208#post1400208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what do you think? Did they do a good job? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Should I throw money at my screen and buy?</div> </div> </div> </div>LUNARS ARE GOOD NOW<br /> <br /> Like, not even &quot;They're basically functional which is the best they've ever been&quot; but no Lunars are ACTUALLY GOOD","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-30T23:56:56-07:00","id":1400246,"title":"","content":"This actually dovetails with something I've been wondering about in the past few weeks. I'm still a little fuzzy on the pathway from concept to final print version that Onyx Path references. Like, I get that first draft is before the second draft, and editing falls somewhere after a complete manuscript has been arrived at, but 'development' and 'redlines' don't feel terribly clear, and it throws off my ability to judge how long it takes to go from 'we have a title' to 'we have a final product'. <br /> <br /> If anyone knows of a historic post where these things got laid out, I would deeply appreciate some direction, because my search-fu has apparently not hit the right keywords yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11867-caffeine-delusions","name":"Caffeine Delusions","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11867_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T05:33:00-07:00","id":1400283,"title":"","content":"Redlines are after the developer receives a draft from the writers, goes through and marks up what needs to be changed, and then sends it back to the writers.<br /> <br /> Development is after the drafts are done, and the developer goes through and makes tweaks to harmonize tone, style, and information.<br /> <br /> As for a timeline, it varies wildly by product. I don't think there's a good way to say, &quot;Well, this is a Night Horrors book. So those usually take about 18 months from first draft announcement to PoD.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T05:55:53-07:00","id":1400291,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pram</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1399372-lunars-book-release?p=1400208#post1400208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what do you think? Did they do a good job? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Should I throw money at my screen and buy?</div> </div> </div> </div>The rules are great. The fluff is pretty good (I really don't like that they completely changed Lilith, but I do like the new Lilith -- IMO would have been better as a new character, but I get it). The rules, are great.<br /> <br /> Shapeshifting is sensible (bit of book keeping). Excellencies are fantastic. Charm power level is very comparable to Solars without being &quot;Solar but Silver&quot; (it's all pretty well balanced, almost no trap options or must-haves, some interesting synergies).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caffeine Delusions</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1399372-lunars-book-release?p=1400246#post1400246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This actually dovetails with something I've been wondering about in the past few weeks. I'm still a little fuzzy on the pathway from concept to final print version that Onyx Path references. Like, I get that first draft is before the second draft, and editing falls somewhere after a complete manuscript has been arrived at, but 'development' and 'redlines' don't feel terribly clear, and it throws off my ability to judge how long it takes to go from 'we have a title' to 'we have a final product'. <br /> <br /> If anyone knows of a historic post where these things got laid out, I would deeply appreciate some direction, because my search-fu has apparently not hit the right keywords yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know what the timeline looks like, but Vance laid out the steps here: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1069023-ask-the-devs?p=1271478#post1271478\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...78#post1271478</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 07-01-2020, 09:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T10:04:32-07:00","id":1400338,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1399372-lunars-book-release?p=1400013#post1400013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Tell that to the Discord yesterday.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I tell nothing to Discord, it is weird and scary to me.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1399372-lunars-book-release?p=1400214#post1400214\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> LUNARS ARE GOOD NOW<br /> <br /> Like, not even &quot;They're basically functional which is the best they've ever been&quot; but no Lunars are ACTUALLY GOOD</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a curious thing to me that in a book in which Lunars have the strongest presentation that they've ever gotten, they should actually feel like they're in a close competition to be the most interesting thing within their own book. It's the benefit of not merely writing Dominions as though they're societies that radiate out from Lunars, but fully realised societies that have been noticeably influenced by Lunars from one quadrant or another but where the Lunar isn't the only thing going. <br /> <br /> Or indeed, where <i>they</i> are the ones that have influenced the <i>Lunar</i>.<br /> <br /> Still, even that serves well in serving as a guide to playing and portraying those characters; firmly established and compelling pictures of a variety of processes and relationships that these Exalted can be involved in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T12:05:28-07:00","id":1400373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1399372-lunars-book-release?p=1400291#post1400291\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know what the timeline looks like, but Vance laid out the steps here: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1069023-ask-the-devs?p=1271478#post1271478\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...78#post1271478</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Precisely what I was hunting for, thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11867-caffeine-delusions","name":"Caffeine Delusions","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11867_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-05T17:32:23-07:00","id":1401230,"title":"","content":"Thank you for letting me know! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Can't wait to get it! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8757-pram","name":"Pram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-11T02:06:20-07:00","id":1402202,"title":"","content":"So, I've done some number crunching based on the Dragonblooded Kickstarter, which when from 'here's the backer PDF' on 12/19/2018 to 'here's your POD coupon' on 4/8/2019. Total timeline of 110 days. <br /> <br /> Now, if Lunars stays true to form, we should be hearing something about it being ready for POD around August 30th. <br /> <br /> That estimate made, there's no denying that these are times that destroy plans with glee and abandon, so don't go holding anyone to anything. Past performance is not an indicator of future results during pandemic conditions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11867-caffeine-delusions","name":"Caffeine Delusions","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11867_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"117"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}